			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401730201,
					"content": "嗯，挺好，小伙子身体没什么毛病，就是饥饿程度比较高，回去多吃点饭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马塔拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730202,
					"content": "那太好了，之前我还听说，有那种出神太久结果身体部位坏死的情况。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730203,
					"content": "这也太可怕了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730204,
					"content": "嗯，总之勒拉，虽然我们之前不认识，但是现在你没事就好，我为你高兴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730205,
					"content": "其实，欧洛伦，只是你不认识我而已…我早就听过你的事情了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730206,
					"content": "#还有茜特菈莉大祭司，{NICKNAME}，派蒙，你们的事迹我都知道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730207,
					"content": "#欸？居然连我和{NICKNAME}都…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730208,
					"content": "说起来还挺不好意思的，因为你们都是我梦寐以求想要成为的人，但事实证明，我只有仰望你们的份。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730209,
					"content": "谁让我生来就是个灵性白痴呢？哈哈，没关系，我已经习惯了被忽视的日子了。谢谢你们救了我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730210,
					"content": "欧洛伦，你说的对，也许这就是人生。我之后不会再做这种危险的事、再给大家添麻烦了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730211,
					"content": "勒拉先生…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730212,
					"content": "不用安慰我啦，哈哈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730213,
					"content": "喂，你这小鬼在说什么呢？你好好看看我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜特菈莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730214,
					"content": "欸？茜特菈莉大祭司，怎么了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730215,
					"content": "让你看就仔细看，感觉出来什么了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜特菈莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730216,
					"content": "奶奶，你在说什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730217,
					"content": "#呃…{NICKNAME}，你说茜特菈莉脸上是不是也写着「乐于助人」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730218,
					"content": "…等一下，好像…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730219,
					"content": "不知道是不是我的错觉，我感觉茜特菈莉大祭司的身体是虚幻的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730220,
					"content": "不…肯定是错觉，我怎么可能看出来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730221,
					"content": "等等，这种套路…是我用过的那个法术，奶奶的真身已经离我们很远了。根本就是脚底抹油。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730222,
					"content": "看见了吗？你已经能察觉到一点灵性的异常了。恭喜你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜特菈莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730223,
					"content": "真…真的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730224,
					"content": "不过这是要去哪里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "欧洛伦"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730225,
					"content": "笨，当然是钓鱼了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜特菈莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730226,
					"content": "我留在山洞里的陷阱被人踩中了，那个叫谷中的家伙上钩了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜特菈莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730227,
					"content": "什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730228,
					"content": "闲话之后再聊，来山洞里找我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "茜特菈莉"
				}
			]
		},
